WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:25.634
Cora looked for a safe spot for everyone.

2
00:00:25.635 --> 00:00:28.678
"There's a cave," she thought.

3
00:00:28.679 --> 00:00:32.003
"I never saw that before."

4
00:00:32.004 --> 00:00:37.528
Cora zoomed into the cave.

5
00:00:37.529 --> 00:00:48.403
Mo swam in behind her.

6
00:00:48.404 --> 00:00:53.259
"Where's Sasha?" Cora asked.

7
00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:59.513
"I don't know!" Mo said.

8
00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:04.263
Cora and Mo waited.

9
00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.856
But Sasha didn't appear.

10
00:01:06.857 --> 00:01:09.666
"Oh no," Cora said.

11
00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:11.815
"I have to find her."

12
00:01:11.816 --> 00:01:18.345
"Not now!" Mo said. "The storm!"

13
00:01:18.346 --> 00:01:33.228
"I'm going!" Cora swam outside.

14
00:01:33.229 --> 00:01:37.247
The storm was over.

15
00:01:37.248 --> 00:01:41.767
The seafloor was a big mess.

16
00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:48.348
Cora looked, but she couldn't find Sasha.

17
00:01:48.349 --> 00:01:52.930
Cora went back to the cave.

18
00:01:52.931 --> 00:01:55.456
She was very upset.

19
00:01:55.457 --> 00:02:00.586
"I swam away too fast and lost Sasha.

20
00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:06.470
How can I find her?"

21
00:02:06.471 --> 00:02:10.207
Suddenly blue lights flashed in the dark cave.

22
00:02:10.208 --> 00:02:14.380
"What's that?" Cora said.

23
00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:22.223
She swam to the back.

24
00:02:22.224 --> 00:02:25.377
She saw a large shell.

25
00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:28.653
Blue lights were swirling out of it.

26
00:02:28.654 --> 00:02:31.661
The strange lights floated toward Cora.

27
00:02:31.662 --> 00:02:35.509
"What is that?" Cora shot ink at it.

28
00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:39.445
But the lights grew even brighter.

29
00:02:39.446 --> 00:02:43.392
"Cora! What's happening?" Mo yelled.

30
00:02:43.393 --> 00:02:47.164
"I don't know!" Cora said.

31
00:02:47.165 --> 00:02:51.968
The blue lights swirled all around her.

